# Shell scripts and container files must keep LF endings: a CRLF shebang
# breaks `./start.sh` inside the Linux containers.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile.* text eol=lf
src/server/websocketproxyserver/Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf

# The server config parser treats a stray CR as a malformed line.
*.conf text eol=lf

# Wire-contract test data is compared byte-for-byte by tests that run inside
# Linux containers over this worktree, where ifstream does no CRLF
# translation. Without eol=lf a checkout on a core.autocrlf=true machine
# fails all 16 golden assertions, the wire-layout inventory and the ratchet
# freshness check — reported as "protocol-breaking change".
tests/golden/*.hex text eol=lf
tests/golden/*.txt text eol=lf
tests/wire-layout.txt text eol=lf
tests/generated/*.inc text eol=lf
tests/ratchet/*.txt text eol=lf
# tests/arch/kernel_files.txt is read by CMake file(STRINGS) inside the
# Linux container: a CRLF checkout leaves \r on every entry, the .cpp$
# match fails, and de-kernel configures with zero sources.
tests/arch/*.txt text eol=lf
tests/arch/*.pl text eol=lf
# Same reason for the critical-section audit: ctest runs it with perl inside
# the container.
tests/tools/*.pl text eol=lf
tools/*.sh text eol=lf
tools/*.pl text eol=lf
# The fuzz corpus converter runs under ctest in the container, and the
# regression inputs are read beside the goldens it converts.
tools/fuzz/*.pl text eol=lf
tests/fuzz/regressions/**/*.hex text eol=lf
# The de-core subset the client vendors (src/domain's sources and its
# parity vectors) is byte-compared with the client's copy by
# tests/tools/decore_client_diff.sh, and the vectors are read in binary by
# formula_tests, which fails a CRLF line. The client pins its copy
# (third_party/decore/**) the same way.
src/domain/** text eol=lf
# The dumps are imported by the MySQL containers and checked by the ratchet
# script inside the dev container; keep them LF like the other inputs above.
initdb/*.sql text eol=lf
cmake/zig-* text eol=lf
Dockerfile.pub.dockerignore text eol=lf
